State / branch mapping (web AiConfirmDialog binds only useTranslation = P1/S10; it fetches nothing.
The native surface wraps it in the repo's standard source/freshness model — identical to sibling
0012 — so every prompt-required state renders real chrome, never a blank box):
  loading  -> request still resolving: ProgressView + "Preparing…" (pinned dialogs).
  empty    -> resolved with no request: ContentUnavailableView "Nothing to approve"; AND within
              content, args == {} renders the <pre> "{}" verbatim (web JSON.stringify({},null,2))
              plus a VoiceOver "No arguments" hint.
  error    -> delivery failed: QueryError-equivalent w/ Retry; inline error kept above content when a
              cached request survives a failed reload.
  stale    -> freshness chip "Stale" + one-shot auto-refresh + cached-data banner.
  offline  -> freshness chip "Offline" + cached request retained, no refetch.
  content branches reproduced + tested: mutates vs read intro, description present/absent, arguments
              present/empty, in-flight (loading prop OR submitting -> both buttons disabled, Approve
              spinner, dismiss locked — web onClose={loading ? noop : onCancel}).

